        <briefdescription>
<para>Select columns by name; nested columns use dot-separated paths. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Columns are returned in schema order, and names that match no column are ignored. An empty list selects no columns; <computeroutput>*</computeroutput> selects all columns. Names are resolved immediately, using the current <ref refid="classiceberg_1_1MetadataScanBuilder_1a1aa8c1fdadcc472b0bd614f93a8aae44" kindref="member">CaseSensitive()</ref> setting. Selecting a map&apos;s value returns the whole map; selecting only its key is an error.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>columns</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Column names from the metadata table&apos;s schema. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
